      "observation": "CENTURY #31 shows Date 'Not recorded' while the Museum's own text for it is titled 'Casey Reas, CENTURY #31, 2021'.",
      "consequence": "A reader sees a date the Museum prints elsewhere reported as missing.",
      "change": "Show the date from the record if one exists, or state that the catalogue text gives 2021.",
      "acceptance_check": "The work record's Date matches the date in its catalogue entry title or says why it differs.",
      "admission": "regression",
